ories from the SQLite store. The standing facts and the round-1 worker finding say: \"mem0 step0's first agent request has n_msg=2 (no recall yet, empty store), but step1/step2 have n_msg=3 (recall present).\"\n\nNow, let me understand the event stream. Let me look at event_samples.json to see the message structure and the agent_end event.\n\nLet me look at the mem0_extract_src.txt to understand the ADDITIVE_EXTRACTION_PROMPT and how the mem prompt is assembled, and pi_prompt_src.txt.\n\nActually, let me be efficient. Let me look at:\n- event_samples.json (message structure)\n- The full structure of mem records (all fields)\n- pi_prompt_src.txt (system prompt reconstruction)\n- mem0_extract_src.txt (mem0 prompt)\n\nLet me look at event_samples.json and the pi_prompt_src.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me examine the event sample structure, the pi prompt source, and the mem0 extract source to understand the message/event format.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"Xsjkapc8oJ6iemBbyvg5wcwdRB2l4P2w","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/dev/garden && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nev=json.load(open('bench/results/2026-10-12/m1-ngram/recon/event_samples.json'))\nprint('type of top:', type(ev).__name__)\nif isinstance(ev, dict):\n    print('keys:', list(ev.keys())[:20])\nelif isinstance(ev, list):\n    print('n items:', len(ev))\n    print('first item keys:', list(ev[0].keys()) if ev and isinstance(ev[0], dict) else type(ev[0]))\n    # show a few distinct event types\n    types={}\n    for e in ev[:400]:\n        t=e.get('type')\n        types[t]=types.get(t,0)+1\n    print('event types:', types)\n\"","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"garden","model":"bonsai-agent","usage":{"input":3253,"output":966,"cacheRead":24559,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":28778,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1791836099041,"responseId":"chatcmpl-V8Ytq